            "detailed_description": "Test your fingers with this simple score chasing game. The basics are simple: there is one correct tile, press the correct key corresponding to it.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are two main mods: Stamina and Speed. <br />\r\nIn Stamina mode, the goal is to never miss a tile, the game is over. Every time you correctly type the tile, you gain a second. How long can you be accurate?<br />\r\nIn Speed mode, the goal is to be fast without missing a tile. Get to a specified number of tiles and check your score. Can you beat your previous scores?",
