                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Heh, this is an interesting little reaction game. It's kind of like the ultra-reduced version of Guitar Hero... Playing on more advanced modes REALLY stretches your concentration. \n\nIt's 79p and if you like reaction games, you'll probablty get your money's worth.  I usually go on about £1 per hour to be worthwhile, and yeah, it's earned that.\n\npros\n* simple\n* challenging\n* configurable\n* stable\n\ncons\n* it's a one-trick pony\n* graphics are are basic as you can possibly imagine.\n\nI'll give it a thumbs-up because, although it's extremely simple, it does exactly what it sets out to.",
